#!/usr/bin/env python
"""Safely apply ZSC-TSD reviewer package v4 on node A or relay B.

V4 adds live reviewer output, deterministic host preflight, an all-carrier
RTP/Opus batch relay, post-network Whisper/fragment decoding, and final
Reed-Solomon/AES-GCM verification. It does not alter prior evidence, models,
database contents, firewall rules, or secrets.
"""

